ARCH| BEGIN
ARCH| 
ARCH|    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARCH|    -- Functionality of the counter:                                              --
ARCH|    --   Load Count | mode                                                        --
ARCH|    --                                                                            --
ARCH|    -- -----------+-------------------                                            --
ARCH|    --     0    0   | halt                                                        --
ARCH|    --     0    1   | count                                                       --
ARCH|    -- up (default)                                                               --
ARCH|    --     1    0   | load                                                        --
