ARCH|    ** The inputs are defined here                                                **
ARCH|    *******************************************************************************/
ARCH|    input [3:0]  address;
ARCH|    input        clock;
ARCH|    input [31:0] data0In;
ARCH|    input [31:0] data1In;
ARCH|    input [31:0] data2In;
ARCH|    input [31:0] data3In;
