ARCH| ARCHITECTURE platformIndependent OF RAM IS 
ARCH| 
ARCH| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARCH| -- Here all private types are defined                                         --
ARCH| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARCH|    TYPE memoryArray IS ARRAY ( 16 DOWNTO 0 ) OF std_logic_vector( 31 DOWNTO 0);
