ARCH| 
ARCH| module RAM( address,
ARCH|             clock,
ARCH|             data0In,
ARCH|             data0Out,
ARCH|             data1In,
ARCH|             data1Out,
ARCH|             data2In,
ARCH|             data2Out,
ARCH|             data3In,
ARCH|             data3Out,
ARCH|             data4In,
ARCH|             data4Out,
ARCH|             data5In,
ARCH|             data5Out,
ARCH|             data6In,
